{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜社區藥物名冊(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-26-13-44-15NdkkGrmn.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：社區藥物名冊</p><p>醫務衞生局下月30日推出社區藥物名冊，共涵蓋151項藥物，擴闊至泌尿科、眼科及皮膚科，預計有幾多病人可受惠？藥費負擔可以減多少？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>醫衞局基層醫療健康專員彭飛舟</p><p>醫衞局策略採購統籌處總監張偉麟</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:02:21.780336+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:57:32.707482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:55:50.903674+00:00","content_hash":"87567817da1f9fbd1e99a00024eb144a977f275703fd6acbcac806b6e9141f83","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}